{% comment %}
  Predictive search input — rendered from the <search-drawer> template inside
  sections/main-nav.liquid (2026-10-10 刘工: the header row shows an icon only;
  the full form lives in the right-side drawer).

  Split from sections/predictive-search.liquid on purpose: a section cannot be
  rendered into another file, but a snippet can. main-nav owns the drawer, so
  the input lives here, while the RESULTS markup lives in the section — that
  file must stand alone because Shopify re-renders it by section_id
  (`section_id=predictive-search` targets the section FILE name).

  Parameters:
    search_section_id — used for input/panel id pairing (unique per section).
    results_limit     — forwarded as data-results-limit for the JS fetch.

  ARIA: the input keeps its combobox + listbox pattern INSIDE the drawer. The
  drawer itself is a modal <dialog>, but the combobox behaviour is unchanged:
  DOM focus stays in the input; arrow keys move a virtual cursor via
  aria-activedescendant. Escape is left to bubble when the results panel is
  closed, so it closes the drawer (layered dismiss: panel → drawer).

  Progressive enhancement baseline: action points at the real search URL, so with JS
  disabled the form still searches. The script only enhances it.
{% endcomment %}

  <predictive-search
    class="predictive-search"
    data-results-limit="{{ results_limit | default: 10 }}"
  >
    {%- comment -%}
      放大镜：纯视觉图标（aria-hidden + tabindex="-1"），可访问入口是输入框
      本身（combobox 语义）。
      清空按钮已移除（2026-10-10 刘工：抽屉里只保留一个 close 图标）——
      换关键词靠全选重打，关抽屉靠右上角 X / Esc / 遮罩。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      class="predictive-search__submit"
      data-predictive-search-submit
      aria-hidden="true"
      tabindex="-1"
    >
      {{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
      <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'search.submit' | t }}</span>
    </button>

    <form
      class="predictive-search__form"
      action="{{ routes.search_url }}"
      method="get"
      role="search"
    >
    <label class="visually-hidden" for="search-input-{{ search_section_id }}">
      {{ 'search.label' | t }}
    </label>

    <input
      id="search-input-{{ search_section_id }}"
      class="predictive-search__input"
      type="search"
      name="q"
      value="{{ search.terms | escape }}"
      placeholder="{{ 'search.placeholder' | t | escape }}"
      autocomplete="off"
      autocorrect="off"
      autocapitalize="off"
      spellcheck="false"
      role="combobox"
      aria-expanded="false"
      aria-controls="predictive-search-results-{{ search_section_id }}"
      aria-autocomplete="list"
      aria-describedby="predictive-search-help-{{ search_section_id }}"
    >

    <button type="submit" class="visually-hidden">
      {{ 'search.submit' | t }}
    </button>

    {%- comment -%}
      说明键盘操作方式。无结果时也保留——它解释的是控件行为，不是结果内容。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p id="predictive-search-help-{{ search_section_id }}" class="visually-hidden">
      {{ 'search.instructions' | t }}
    </p>

    {%- comment -%}
      结果容器由 JS 注入 HTML 片段。aria-controls 指向这个 id，
      JS 注入内容时复用同一个 id。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div
      class="predictive-search__panel"
      id="predictive-search-results-{{ search_section_id }}"
      hidden
    ></div>
  </form>
</predictive-search>

{% stylesheet %}
  .predictive-search {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    inline-size: 100%;
    max-inline-size: 32rem;
  }

  .predictive-search__form {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .predictive-search__submit {
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline-start: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    inline-size: 44px;
    block-size: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    /* 图标按钮压在输入框左侧，输入框留出等宽内边距 */
    inset-block-start: 50%;
    translate: 0 -50%;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    pointer-events: none; /* 点击穿透到输入框：它只是视觉图标 */
  }

  .predictive-search__submit svg {
    inline-size: 1.125rem;
    block-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .predictive-search__input {
    inline-size: 100%;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    min-block-size: 44px;
    padding: 0.5rem 2.75rem 0.5rem 2.75rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 20%);
    border-radius: var(--style-border-radius-inputs);
    font: inherit;
    appearance: none;
  }

  .predictive-search__input:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 1px;
  }

  .predictive-search__clear {
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline-end: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    inline-size: 44px;
    block-size: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* 无输入时隐藏（JS 用 hidden 属性控制，此处兜底初始态） */
  .predictive-search__clear[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .predictive-search__clear svg {
    inline-size: 1rem;
    block-size: 1rem;
  }

  .predictive-search__panel {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-start: calc(100% + 0.25rem);
    inset-inline: 0;
    z-index: 30;
    max-block-size: min(70vh, 32rem);
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .predictive-search__panel[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
